# Copy to .env.local for local use; on Netlify set the same names under
# Site configuration > Environment variables. Everything here is optional, and
# every NEXT_PUBLIC_* value is inlined at build time (and visible in the page),
# so a change needs a redeploy and none of it may be a secret.

# Origin the site advertises in canonical URLs, hreflang, the sitemap, OG
# images and structured data. No trailing slash. Leave unset to use
# https://itswandana.netlify.app; set it for a custom domain or a preview deploy.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com

# Cloudflare Web Analytics site token: Cloudflare dashboard > Web Analytics >
# Manage site > the "token" value inside the JS snippet. Analytics stays off
# when this is empty, and never loads under `npm run dev`. On Netlify, scope it
# to Production so deploy previews are not counted.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CF_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=
